## Deployment Notes

### To Enable Analytics on Vercel:
1. Navigate to your project in the Vercel dashboard
2. Go to the Analytics tab
3. Click "Enable" button in the header
4. Deploy the application using `vercel deploy`

### Analytics Features Available:
- Page view tracking (automatic)
- Unique visitor tracking
- Top pages analytics
- Referrer tracking
- Device and browser analytics

## No Changes Required
The project already has Vercel Web Analytics correctly installed and configured according to the latest official documentation. The implementation is production-ready and will begin tracking once enabled in the Vercel dashboard and deployed.
